// Campaign chapter 4 (B-032, plan §19's expansion test — Update 5): the
// second faction's debut. The mission player runs THE PHALANX on Iron
// Basin — the anvil army on the anvil map — against a scripted opponent
// playing the same faction (a match plays one faction; the mission's
// bundle bakes the Phalanx for every slot, B-032's played-faction seam).
//
// The objectives are chapter 1's proven shape, translated: destroy the
// enemy command center (required — the surgical target, not the
// elimination rule) and field the wall (optional — six hoplites exist;
// the Phalanx starts two, so the count sits above the starting force the
// way AUD-003's law demands: real production, never a vacuous count).
//
// No fog preset, no restrictions, no AI tuning: the debut carries the
// faction itself — the scripted Alpha's plan resolves on the Phalanx's
// own production lists (the producers-map sort law, A-223, held by
// design: the barracks sorts first and carries the army), and the
// balance is the A14 sessions' first Phalanx read (A-230).
(
    schema_version: 1,
    id: "anvil_01",
    display_name: "The Anvil",
    map: "iron_basin_72",
    faction: "phalanx",
    rules: "alpha",
    objectives: [
        // Break the enemy command center through the basin's lanes — the
        // sapper's purpose (the battery's P4: the breaker breaks the
        // turtle) and the chapter's exam.
        (
            kind: "Destroy",
            parameters: Destroy(( target_kind: Some("command_center") )),
            optional: false,
        ),
        // Field the wall — five hoplites exist. The Phalanx starts two
        // (the anvil opening), so three more must be trained, and the
        // count is the loader's population-fit ceiling (the base cap 10
        // fields at most five two-pop hoplites; the sixth needs a supply
        // depot the static gate will not presume). The starting ore funds
        // none of them — the opening economy must gather, exactly as
        // chapter 1's workers had to.
        (
            kind: "BuildTrain",
            parameters: BuildTrain(( kind: "hoplite", count: 5 )),
            optional: true,
        ),
    ],
)
